383
00:30:03,705 --> 00:30:05,840
Temukan Maui,

384
00:30:05,973 --> 00:30:09,376
bawa dia menyeberangi lautan luas

385
00:30:09,510 --> 00:30:13,313
untuk mengembalikan hati Te Fiti...

386
00:30:15,315 --> 00:30:17,284
...dan selamatkan kita semua.

387
00:30:49,951 --> 00:30:54,122
Leluhur kita percaya

388
00:30:54,254 --> 00:30:57,390
